{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":75,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A Psalm by Asaph. A song."},{"n":1,"text":"We give thanks to you, God. We give thanks, for your Name is near. Men tell about your wondrous works.","tok":[{"t":"We give thanks "},{"t":"to","s":["H7892"]},{"t":" you, God. We give thanks, for your Name is near. Men tell about your wondrous works."}]},{"n":2,"text":"When I choose the appointed time, I will judge blamelessly.","tok":[{"t":"When "},{"t":"I","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" choose "},{"t":"the","s":["H3034"]},{"t":" appointed time, "},{"t":"I","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" judge blamelessly."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The earth and all its inhabitants quake. I firmly hold its pillars. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"The","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" earth "},{"t":"and","s":["H3947"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"all","s":["H3947"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"its","s":["H3947"]},{"t":" inhabitants quake. "},{"t":"I","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" firmly hold "},{"t":"its","s":["H3947"]},{"t":" pillars. Selah."}]},{"n":4,"text":"I said to the arrogant, “Don’t boast!” I said to the wicked, “Don’t lift up the horn.","tok":[{"t":"I","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" said "},{"t":"to","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" arrogant, “Don’t boast!” "},{"t":"I","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" said "},{"t":"to","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" wicked, “Don’t lift "},{"t":"up","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" horn."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Don’t lift up your horn on high. Don’t speak with a stiff neck.”","tok":[{"t":"Don’t "},{"t":"lift","s":["H7311"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"up","s":["H7311"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H7311"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"horn","s":["H7161"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"on","s":["H7161"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"high","s":["H7311"]},{"t":". Don’t speak "},{"t":"with","s":["H7161"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" stiff neck.”"}]},{"n":6,"text":"For neither from th